#
# fivestar-loader --input-script: answers the first-run screens of an empty save folder unattended, up to the story
# load (docs/running.md#first-run-in-the-game). Times are seconds from loader start; the screens' own timing comes
# from a warm pipeline cache on a 24-core PC, where the "press a button" screen shows 135 to 220 s in.
#
# The "press a button" screen (black): short taps until it has surely passed. A tap does not confirm the option
# screens behind it, which need A held.
130 Space repeat 43 every 4
# Minimap, text size, the Off option, brightness, controls notice: A held 1.5 s each.
350 Space hold 1.5 repeat 5 every 15
# Legal and photosensitivity: focus down twice (the photosensitivity item keeps the focus about 15 s), then Next.
425 Down
440 Down
455 Space
# Privacy policy and terms of service: scroll each text to its end with the right stick (cursor down at 800 px/s),
# check it with A, move down; then Confirm.
475 cursor 0 800 hold 30
507 Space
510 Down
513 cursor 0 800 hold 30
545 Space
548 Down
551 Space
# The story load (a spinner on dark blue) starts about here.
